      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 / 到期 lot 筛选（规划）\n读取 lots[lotId] / outstanding[token]\n同一资产；未释放量足够\n链时间到期；来源/目标无 HOLD\n未知直入款不加入结算候选",
      "originalText": "1 / 到期 lot 筛选（规划）\n读取 lots[lotId] / outstanding[token]\n同一资产；未释放量足够\n链时间到期；来源/目标无 HOLD\n未知直入款不加入结算候选",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-03-clearing-settlement-lots",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
