      "text": "2 / 固定集合批准（规划）\nlotIds[] + amounts[]；1—50 项\n禁止重复 lotId；允许分批释放\nlotsHash = keccak256(abi.encode(...))\n绑定 evidenceDigest 与 operationId",
      "originalText": "2 / 固定集合批准（规划）\nlotIds[] + amounts[]；1—50 项\n禁止重复 lotId；允许分批释放\nlotsHash = keccak256(abi.encode(...))\n绑定 evidenceDigest 与 operationId",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
