      "text": "3 / SettlementAuthorizer（规划）\nSETTLEMENT_SIGNER 签名\n绑定源/目标全局与资产 epochs\nrouteEpoch / signerEpoch / 有效期\nhashSettlement 比对并持久 ACK",
      "originalText": "3 / SettlementAuthorizer（规划）\nSETTLEMENT_SIGNER 签名\n绑定源/目标全局与资产 epochs\nrouteEpoch / signerEpoch / 有效期\nhashSettlement 比对并持久 ACK",
