      "text": "7 / 最终链证据（规划）\nLotReleased（每个 lot 分项）\nSettlementExecuted（总额）\noperationStatus = Executed\n失败整笔回滚，旧 Permit 仍可能有效",
      "originalText": "7 / 最终链证据（规划）\nLotReleased（每个 lot 分项）\nSettlementExecuted（总额）\noperationStatus = Executed\n失败整笔回滚，旧 Permit 仍可能有效",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-03-clearing-settlement-receipt",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
